      "pronunciation": "noh meh GOOS-tah PAH-rah NAH-dah",
      "example": "El frío [no me gusta para nada].",
      "example_en": "I don't like the cold at all.",
      "region": "General",
      "register": "casual"
    },
    {
      "id": "feelings:me-molesta",
