      "example_en": "\"Is she coming?\" \"I think so.\"",
      "region": "General",
      "register": "casual"
    },
    {
      "id": "feelings:creo-que-no",
      "spanish": "Creo que no",
      "english": "I don't think so",
      "pronunciation": "KREH-oh keh noh",
